        "id": 224022,
        "name": "Entchen",
        "username": "Entchen",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/6a8cbe/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-28T12:36:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unlocked, and I know how to post logs now! Unfortunately, it's only half the game, but hopefully still helpful.&nbsp; Greatest Legacy, TLTachyon, Cosmic, Medico, and Mainstay v. Ambuscade in Silver Gulch.&nbsp; I actually watched that absurd 7 hour gameplay video (mostly to see Lifeline, but then I felt committed)&nbsp;and got some ideas on effective use of Cosmic and his constructs.&nbsp; Between Energy Bracers and Legacy's Next Evolutioning Energy, Fire, and Projectile Damage, my heroes were taking very little harm and were basically all at full health almost&nbsp; the entire game.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I believe I had played all of Mainstay's ongoings at some point or another, and I'd destroyed at least one Leader of the Pack and two Preemptive Paybacks (once due to its own text, once from another card that allowed me to destroy an ongoing).&nbsp; I'd definitely played a few one-shots, but not many.&nbsp; Trash and Deck were either empty or mostly empty.&nbsp; Order of destruction was Vest, Rhonda, Belter, which was the default \"choose for me\" order.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pastebin.com/wSzz7Kd2\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Link to log if it's easier to read this way</a>.</p>",
