        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-01T13:52:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The community has discovered the official unlock condition for Void Guard Road Warrior Mainstay.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>First, all 3 of Void Guard Mainstay's equipment cards must enter and remain in play for at least 3 rounds. Then, in the same game, Void Guard Mainstay must destroy all 3 of his equipment cards in one turn.</strong></p>",
