        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-02T17:51:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, glad that worked! I've been so eager to ramp the three equips that i always destroyed them before three turns!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Guess playing Mainstay's entire deck in two turns isn't condusive to getting the unlock&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>finally lol</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Side note: is this variant that good? It doesn't seem to be a particularly useful variant power?</p>",
