        "created_at": "2018-12-02T20:38:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the Steam folks seem to get more unlocks than we do here. I can't remember the last time an unlock wasn't solved either there or on Discord.</p>\n<p>I find RW Mainstay to be night and difficult to use, but in a few cases, he's just nuts. Against Matriarch, for instance. Having Medico around is highly recommended, though.</p>",
