        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-03T00:08:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Of the Void Guard variants, I find I tend to prefer the base character, but Road Warrior Mainstay is an awful lot of fun. Granted, if he's not taking lots of damage, the power's pretty much useless, but there are ways around that...</p>",
